# NOTE: splits/ and reports/ ARE tracked on purpose.
# The frozen split manifest and the milestone reports are part of the
# reproducibility claim and must live in git.

# ---- Local working documents (kept on disk, not published) ----
# These drive day-to-day work but are not part of the published artifact.
# They were untracked deliberately; history was not rewritten, so earlier
# commits still contain them.
.claude/
.agents/
.github/
CLAUDE.md
PLAN.md
PROGRESS.md
interview*.md
INTERVIEW_PREP.md
*.private.md
/docs/superpowers/

